WEBVTT

00:00:27.206 --> 00:00:30.959
so she feels the vibrations
of sound in the music.

00:00:32.068 --> 00:00:35.354
And music has psychological effects on us.

00:00:35.722 --> 00:00:42.015
It invokes feelings of nostalgia,
happiness, sadness,

00:00:42.039 --> 00:00:43.312
falling in love.

00:00:43.774 --> 00:00:46.678
It makes you have a feeling
of connectedness,

00:00:46.702 --> 00:00:48.281
and unfortunately,

00:00:48.305 --> 00:00:51.515
Deaf and hard-of-hearing people
are excluded from these events,

00:00:51.539 --> 00:00:55.501
because obtaining a sign-language
interpreter is so difficult

00:00:55.525 --> 00:00:57.524
and so overwhelming

00:00:57.548 --> 00:01:01.190
that they simply don't buy
the tickets or they just give up,